    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardIntro">The donation flow is now a guided popup: enter your VRCLS account, load the current plan, pay, then let the client verify the automatic activation result.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardStepsTitle">Flow</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardStep1">1. Enter your VRCLS account and password to load the current plan. If the account does not exist yet, the server will register it automatically after payment.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardStep2">2. Choose the amount and plan, generate the payment link, and complete payment on Afdian.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardStep3">3. Return to the client after payment and confirm this donation request.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardStep4">4. The client polls the usage query 3 times with a 10 second interval to verify that quota and expiration have updated.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardCardTitle">Guided Donation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="UserCenterDonationWizardCardSubtitle">No more manual remark activation. The server activates automatically and the client only guides and verifies.</sys:String>
